{"seq":1,"slug":"computer-architecture-assembly","title":"计算机组成与装配","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/hardware-maintenance/computer-architecture-assembly","wordCount":1141,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"计算机组成与装配\">计算机组成与装配</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>计算机硬件组装是每位 IT 从业者的入门必修课。一台计算机由中央处理器（CPU）、内存（RAM）、主板、存储设备、显卡、电源、机箱及散热系统组成，各部件通过总线和接口协同工作。掌握每个部件的技术指标、选购要点和正确安装方法，是胜任计算机维修工岗位的第一步。</p>\n<h3 id=\"cpu-选型与安装\">CPU 选型与安装</h3><p>CPU 是计算机的运算核心。2026 年主流桌面平台为 Intel 第 14/15 代酷睿和 AMD Ryzen 7000/8000 系列。选型时关注以下参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>选型建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心/线程数</td>\n<td>并行处理能力</td>\n<td>办公 4核8线程足够，设计/开发建议 8核以上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础/睿频频率</td>\n<td>单核性能指标</td>\n<td>日常使用关注睿频，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>4.5</mn><mtext>GHz</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{boost} \\geq 4.5\\text{GHz}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oos</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GHz</span></span></span></span></span></span> 为佳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TDP 功耗</td>\n<td>散热需求参考</td>\n<td>65W 适合静音方案，125W+ 需要塔式散热器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>插槽类型</td>\n<td>与主板兼容性</td>\n<td>LGA 1700（Intel）/ AM5（AMD）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>安装步骤：打开主板 CPU 插槽压杆 → 对准防呆缺口放入 CPU → 压下固定杆 → 涂抹导热硅脂（米粒大小）→ 安装散热器并连接风扇供电线。</p>\n<h3 id=\"内存选型与安装\">内存选型与安装</h3><p>2026 年主流内存规格为 DDR5，频率从 4800MHz 到 8000MHz 不等。中职实训推荐配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>办公/学习用途：DDR5 4800MHz × 2（双通道 16GB）</li>\n<li>设计/开发用途：DDR5 5600MHz × 2（双通道 32GB）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>内存条安装需对准防呆槽位，两端卡扣打开后垂直按入直至&quot;咔嗒&quot;锁定。双通道配置应插在相同颜色的插槽中（通常为第 2、4 槽）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主板与存储设备\">主板与存储设备</h3><p>主板是连接所有部件的枢纽。选型要点：芯片组兼容性、扩展插槽数量（PCIe 5.0 x16 显卡槽、M.2 固态槽）、USB/网口接口规格、供电相数。</p>\n<p>存储设备选择：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;存储需求分析&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;预算充足?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C[&quot;NVMe SSD 1TB&lt;br/&gt;读写 &gt;5000MB/s&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| D[&quot;SATA SSD 512GB&lt;br/&gt;+ HDD 1TB 组合&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;M.2 接口安装&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;SATA 线缆连接&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"存储需求分析\"] --&gt; B{\"预算充足?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"是\"| C[\"NVMe SSD 1TB&lt;br/&gt;读写 &gt;5000MB/s\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"否\"| D[\"SATA SSD 512GB&lt;br/&gt;+ HDD 1TB 组合\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"M.2 接口安装\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"SATA 线缆连接\"]</pre><h3 id=\"显卡与电源\">显卡与电源</h3><p>独立显卡按需选配：纯办公可依赖核显，图形处理选择 NVIDIA RTX 4060 或 AMD RX 7600 级别。电源功率计算公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{recommended} = (P_{CPU} + P_{GPU} + P_{other}) \\times 1.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mm</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GP</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{other}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 包含主板、内存、风扇、硬盘等，通常估算为 80-120W。建议选择 80PLUS 铜牌以上认证的电源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"整机组装流程\">整机组装流程</h3><p>标准组装顺序：①安装 CPU 和散热器到主板 → ②插入内存条 → ③将主板固定到机箱 → ④安装电源 → ⑤安装存储设备 → ⑥安装显卡 → ⑦连接所有供电线和数据线 → ⑧理线扎带整理 → ⑨接通电源首次点亮。</p>\n<h3 id=\"bios-uefi-设置\">BIOS/UEFI 设置</h3><p>首次点亮后进入 BIOS（按 Del 或 F2），需检查并设置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>确认 CPU、内存被正确识别</li>\n<li>设置启动顺序（Boot Priority）：U盘/光驱优先用于系统安装</li>\n<li>开启 XMP/EXPO 内存超频预设</li>\n<li>确认安全启动（Secure Boot）状态</li>\n<li>设置风扇转速曲线</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026 年硬件领域的关键趋势：DDR5 内存全面普及，PCIe 5.0 固态硬盘读写速度突破 12GB/s；AI 加速成为消费级硬件标配，Intel 和 AMD 的最新 CPU 均内置 NPU（神经网络处理单元）；模块化 PC 概念开始进入教育市场，如 Framework 笔记本允许用户自行更换 CPU 和 GPU 模块；散热技术方面，液态金属导热和半导体制冷片在高端平台获得应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为某学校机房拟定一份 30 台办公电脑的配置清单，总预算 12 万元，要求能流畅运行 Office 套件和网页浏览，写出选型理由。</li>\n<li>实际动手组装一台完整主机，记录每一步操作并拍照，整理成图文并茂的组装报告。</li>\n<li>解释为什么&quot;先装 CPU 散热器再装主板到机箱&quot;是更好的操作顺序？如果反过来会遇到什么困难？</li>\n<li>某同学组装完成后按下电源键无任何反应（风扇不转、指示灯不亮），列出至少 5 个可能的原因，并设计排查步骤。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本节以实际岗位需求为导向，系统讲解了计算机各核心部件的技术参数、选型策略和标准化组装流程。重点掌握 CPU/内存/存储/显卡的兼容性匹配、规范的安装手法以及 BIOS 基础配置，为后续的系统部署和故障排除打下硬件层面的坚实基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"计算机组成与装配","id":"计算机组成与装配"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"CPU 选型与安装","id":"cpu-选型与安装"},{"level":3,"text":"内存选型与安装","id":"内存选型与安装"},{"level":3,"text":"主板与存储设备","id":"主板与存储设备"},{"level":3,"text":"显卡与电源","id":"显卡与电源"},{"level":3,"text":"整机组装流程","id":"整机组装流程"},{"level":3,"text":"BIOS/UEFI 设置","id":"bios-uefi-设置"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"操作系统管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/hardware-maintenance/operating-system-management"}}